+# Placeholder art & audio (prototype slice)
+
+Per the spec: **colored-rect buildings + emoji signage + system sounds only** —
+no custom art in this slice, no third-party assets, no art purchases.
+
+- **Buildings** are colored `Panel` rects rendered procedurally by
+  `scripts/street.gd` (`ASSET_COLORS` per asset type), sized by upgrade level.
+- **Signage** is emoji in `Label`s (`economy.gd` asset/job catalogs carry the
+  icon per type). System fonts render them; nothing ships on disk.
+- **Sounds** are synthesized at runtime by `scripts/sfx.gd`
+  (`AudioStreamWAV` tone) — the wage coin-blip juice moment.
+
+If a directory of files ever replaces this, it lands here — and gets a real
+art pass only after the playtest gate.
